{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Pontryagin对偶"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Pontryagin 对偶"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>局部紧 Abel 群</h3>\n<p>记 $\\mathsf{LCA}$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"局部紧Abel群","text":"局部紧 Abel 群"}},{"Plain":"的范畴, 其中态射为连续同态. 记 $\\mathbb T = \\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Z}$ 为圆环, 定义局部紧 Abel 群 $G$ 的 <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"Pontryagin对偶","text":"Pontryagin 对偶"}},{"Plain":"为\n$$\r\n\\widehat G = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{LCA}}(G,\\mathbb T).\r\n$$\n(配备紧开拓扑.) 这给出函子 $\\widehat{(-)}\\colon \\mathsf{LCA}^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{LCA}$.</p>\n<p>自然同态 $G \\to \\widehat {\\widehat {G}}$, $x\\mapsto (\\chi\\mapsto \\chi(x))$ 是同构. 换言之, 对偶函子复合两次是恒等: $\\widehat{(-)}\\circ \\widehat{(-)}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\simeq\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathsf{LCA}}$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}\\simeq \\mathbb T$, $\\widehat {\\mathbb T}\\simeq\\mathbb{Z}$.</li>\n<li>$\\widehat {\\mathbb{R}} \\simeq \\mathbb{R}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>紧–离散对偶</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>若 $G$ 为紧群, 则 $\\widehat {G}$ 为离散群.</li>\n<li>若 $G$ 为离散群, 则 $\\widehat {G}$ 为紧群.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"调和分析","text":"调和分析"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Fourier变换","text":"Fourier 变换"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}